## Post-mortem checklist

After the incident is resolved, complete this checklist:

- [ ] Capture timeline (detection → mitigation → resolution; UTC timestamps).
- [ ] Identify root cause (use 5-whys or fishbone analysis).
- [ ] Write blameless post-mortem in `<WORKSPACE>/docs/post-mortems/YYYY-MM-DD_<short_name>.md`.
- [ ] Propagate the fix to related modules (check the project's architecture notes, for example ARCHITECTURE.md, for cross-module contracts).
- [ ] Add a regression test (or a monitoring check that would have caught this earlier).

